StudentHub Portal
1. Problem Scope
Problem Statement
College students often use different platforms to access attendance, timetables, assignments, academic calendars, announcements, and study materials. This makes it difficult to manage academic information efficiently.
StudentHub is a centralized web portal where students can access all academic services from one platform after logging in.
Objectives
•	Provide one dashboard for all student services. 
•	Easy navigation between modules. 
•	Reduce paperwork. 
•	Improve communication between students and faculty. 
•	Store academic information digitally.
2. User Roles
User Role	Responsibilities
Student	View attendance, timetable, assignments, profile, study materials, announcements
Faculty	Upload attendance, assignments, notices, study notes
Admin	Manage students, faculty, announcements, academic calendar, portal maintenance


